WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.710
A Proposal for Enriching Extracurricular Activities
关于丰富课外活动的建议

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:17.620
Extracurricular activities are an important part of college life, but at present most of the activities on our campus are limited to sports competitions and evening shows.
课外活动是大学生活的重要组成部分，但目前我们校园里的活动大多局限于体育比赛和晚会。

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:25.140
To make campus life more rewarding, I would like to propose that the student union organize the following activities.
为了让校园生活更有收获，我想建议学生会组织以下活动。

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:32.120
First, the union could set up reading clubs in which students meet every week to share books and exchange ideas.
第一，学生会可以成立读书会，让同学们每周聚会，分享书籍、交流想法。

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:38.570
This would not only broaden their knowledge but also help them think critically and express themselves clearly.
这不仅能拓宽他们的知识面，还能帮助他们进行批判性思考，并清楚地表达自己。

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:46.710
Second, I suggest holding regular workshops on practical skills such as photography, public speaking and basic coding.
第二，我建议定期举办实用技能工作坊，比如摄影、公开演讲和基础编程。

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:52.880
These skills are seldom taught in class but are very useful in daily life and future careers.
这些技能课堂上很少教，但在日常生活和未来的职业中非常有用。

00:00:53.680 --> 00:01:06.860
Third, volunteer activities, such as tutoring children in nearby communities or helping at local nursing homes, should also be organized regularly, because they help students develop a sense of responsibility.
第三，还应该定期组织志愿活动，比如为附近社区的孩子辅导功课或者去本地的养老院帮忙，因为这些活动能帮助同学们培养责任感。

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:14.000
These activities would appeal to students with different interests and help them grow into well-rounded individuals.
这些活动会吸引兴趣各不相同的同学，并帮助他们成长为全面发展的人。

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:18.080
I hope the student union will find these ideas worth trying.
我希望学生会觉得这些想法值得一试。
